speechtext:
The crews, exclusive of officers, are as follows : ' Druid,' 23: 'Aberdeen,' 31; 'Stanley,' 34; 'Minto,' 37; ' Lady Laurier,' 36; * Lansdowne,' 26 ;
' Quadra.' 20; ' Brant,' 8; ' Champlain,' 28 ; 'Montcalm,' 35; * Maisonneuve,' 3; 'Con-Mr. FOSTER.
stance,' 18; ' Shamrock,' 14 ; ' Scout,' 11, and ' Reserve,' 9. The ' Canada ' has a crew of 48 exclusive of officers.
